{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03、S11、S13等短时段的感受提示过于密集，字又小，普通观众可能来不及读；X的左右并列更方便快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y胜在把人物心理的关键转折突出出来，并且让音乐感受与具体段落、人物当下的反应发生对应，尤其是从怀念、矛盾、孤独到重新站稳的过程，前后呼应更充分。它不仅告诉观众人物有什么感受，还通过具体的音色、节奏、旋律变化和身体感受，让人理解这些感受如何发生、如何改变。X更容易一眼扫过，但右侧短词较像分散的情绪标签，音乐细节与人物心理之间的联系不够紧密。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a2ea75bc-b131-43ee-8c92-6932899ebb71", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T154937088833Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:51:05.901483+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c08207e68bd98f58e92f7713a5c147b49fcad6d9210a064520c43af7b9477e4f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_